{"title":"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaa557b915b9312a4ce982756ecfde9c67a11d17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^4)^8}{(4^8)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"44\" height=\"45\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c281e9c975b44542037f905df52835646971f6b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }\\frac{1}{4} \\qquad \\text{(B) }\\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(C) }1 \\qquad \\text{(D) }2 \\qquad \\text{(E) }8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"341\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use basic rules of exponentiation to solve this problem.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/884df07288fd3ea05bb2dd3ae4c7adeb1d3484b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^4)^8}{(4^8)^2}  =\\frac{(2^4)^8}{(2^{16})^2}  =\\frac{2^{32}}{2^{32}}  =1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"202\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b276e0e83ab5d138363cdd8426564ac2c1e063.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"62\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rearrange the exponents on the bottom to solve this problem:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a29b7c569da39a87913e52cc5d3c215a9db8ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^4)^8}{(4^8)^2}  =\\frac{(2^4)^8}{(4^{2})^8}  =\\frac{16^{8}}{16^{8}}  =\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"244\" height=\"45\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.